{"productId": "80ad48d4-80ab-4039-9c43-d54a81124f7e", "modelName": "Big Boy", "modelDescription": "As the perfect companion to ride alongside our world-famous Big Boy rifle or as the star of its own show, the Big Boy Revolver is a classically styled six-shooter fully capable of bringing the Henry name into the wild world of wheel guns with the same attention to detail and American craftsmanship you know and love.Available with square Gunfighter-style grips for maximum control or rounded, compact Birdshead-style grips for better concealment, this traditional double-action handgun would look right at home on the shelf of a Wild West general store. Borrowing design cues from its long gun brethren, the Big Boy Revolver touts highly polished blued steel throughout the medium-sized frame, quick-release cylinder, and 4\u201d barrel. In addition, genuine American walnut grip panels are affixed to both sides of a mirror-like brass trigger guard that\u2019s visible around the grip to the top of the backstrap. At about 34 ounces, these revolvers carry easily yet shoot softly with a smooth pull and hammer drop in double action and a crisp break in single action. A traditional revolver sight picture is achieved with a fixed notch cut directly into the frame and a ramped blade front sight, of which three sizes are included for regulating the point of aim to match the point of impact. Like its rifle counterpart, a transfer bar safety keeps the firing pin from striking a loaded chamber unless the hammer is cocked back and the trigger is squeezed.From full-house .357 Magnum loads for hunting to light .38 Special target loads for easy plinking, the Big Boy Revolver will eat all you can feed it. So whether shooting for fun or meat, having your long gun and sidearm chamber the same cartridge is convenient \u2014 that\u2019s Cowboy Logistics at its finest.As the first-ever revolver under our belt, serious collectors and connoisseurs of the Henry mark will relish the opportunity to add both variants to their safe. Modern design features with historically consistent style have always been our hallmark, and the Big Boy Revolver is no exception.", "manufacturerName": "Henry Repeating Arms", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "38c145fa-fd4e-48b9-8b9c-c585c7ec8462", "description": "Henry Repeating Arms, H17 Big Boy Deadeye, Steel Frame Revolver, Double Action/Single Action, .357 Magnum/.38 Special, 4\" Barrel, Round Blued Steel, Polished Blued Steel Receiver, American Walnut Gunfighter Grip, Adjustable Rear Sight, Ramped Fiber Optic Front Sight, 6 Rounds", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/e70c6766-f1f3-4df3-a2d9-9aba46edff8b", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/44ea7803-6b37-4f2b-a46e-b0415cdb89e2", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/08c450c0-0980-4e5f-91b0-f88b3c09d50f", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/93559e65-4ffb-4a7c-8e1e-acbdfd9a09fb", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/63c128c8-b5a3-461a-8ea2-ecf1cbb7112c", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/3afc69ab-c048-401c-be34-7ca2dcc7ecad"], "isDefault": false, "manufacturerPartNumber": "H017GDMA", "upc": "619835400772", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "2fa81b83-a1b1-4729-b87f-fbaba467061c", "attributeName": "Caliber", "attributeValueId": "a4a9b717-7010-4d62-9e8f-72f53b86adb2", "valueName": "357 Magnum"}, {"attributeNameId": "1dbab5b3-c07e-4fd5-93de-487557a9fe2d", "attributeName": "Factory Equipped Sights", "attributeValueId": "3a40498a-362d-4960-ba99-f483f13f5c78", "valueName": "Adjustable"}, {"attributeNameId": "5484bfc3-10d4-4ad1-ba8b-bd2973f49143", "attributeName": "Color", "attributeValueId": "a450f6e6-20ed-45d9-9ff4-67810849560d", "valueName": "Blued"}, {"attributeNameId": "70a78e78-6640-4f36-af23-93d050b3c0b2", "attributeName": "Capacity", "attributeValueId": "44ba4f9a-d33f-4b4c-99c2-acbca7e72010", "valueName": "6 Round"}, {"attributeNameId": "70cd5184